%% title: SCA Challenge Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : challenge created
    PENDING --> PENDING : verify attempt (attempt_count++)
    PENDING --> COMPLETED : verification success\n(consumed_at set — RTS Art.5 replay guard)
    PENDING --> FAILED : max_attempts exceeded\nor expired
    PENDING --> EXPIRED : expires_at passed\nbefore completion
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
